  "solution": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <title>My Page</title>\n  <style>\n    .card {\n      width: 280px;\n      padding: 20px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      border: 1px solid #ccc;\n      background: #f0fdf4;\n    }\n    .card h2 {\n      text-align: center;\n      color: #166534;\n    }\n    .card .tags {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h2>Chilaka</h2>\n    <p>Parrot, teacher, coder.</p>\n    <div class=\"tags\"><span>python</span><span>go</span><span>sql</span></div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
